  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpixeldreamstudios.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Header.webp\" alt=\"\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>在本整合包的开发过程中，我使用了 BisectHosting 的服务器来测试多人兼容性与性能。配置过程十分快捷，服务器运行该整合包时流畅且毫无问题。</p>\n<p>如果你打算搭建服务器与好友联机游玩，我强烈推荐 BisectHosting。</p>\n<p>结账时使用优惠码 <strong>PIXELDREAM</strong>&nbsp;，即可在首台游戏服务器上 <strong>立减25%。</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fPixelDream\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Promo.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Description.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们的目标是将大量<strong>奇幻主题内容</strong>融入《我的世界》，同时保留原汁原味的<strong>原版体验</strong>。得益于众多<strong>性能优化模组</strong>，该整合包已进行调优，以确保在各类设备上均能实现<strong>流畅运行</strong>。此外，我们精心协调了所有模组的配置，力求达到<strong>无缝兼容</strong>。如果你和我一样是个极客（就像我们一样），一定会爱上整包中四处散布的、向热门奇幻影视与游戏致敬的<strong>巧妙彩蛋与隐藏惊喜</strong>。欲了解更多详情，欢迎查阅<strong>Wiki</strong>。</p>\n<p>想了解所有可用职业的详细机制，请观看我们社区成员制作的<a href=\"https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLN0QC7Gx4uK72neKTJ_thPLktglRi6ZBU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">这一系列视频</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.pixeldreamstudios.net%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Discord.webp\" alt=\"\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/FANTASY_MINECRAFT/MP_FANTASY_MINECRAFT_Showcase.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/F5G55CZCfHg\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/rBNGyzgVBn4\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RPS5MvvUYr8\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/XJX0DIUfJ4s\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aMsSDkVxkOI\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/IH47uKX5P_Y\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/k5UmBiYw-LY?si=iCWB9sAfbWDjhm0C\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/U2Upz1ixTTo?si=YC5dxo9d9rs2Tz8h\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MxQLjwVJIGs?si=0PWTzJ6mQ1JnfXO3\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
